                    <note corresp="http://syriaca.org/nhsl" type="abstract" xml:lang="en" source="#bib2500-7">A two-part universal history composed originally by <persName ref="http://syriaca.org/person/239">Bar Hebraeus</persName> and 
                        continued by later authors. <title xml:lang="en" ref="http://syriaca.org/work/2501">Part 1</title> deals with secular history and <title xml:lang="en" ref="http://syriaca.org/work/2502">Part 2</title> 
                        with church history. For editions and translations, see the bibliography of each of these parts, which have been published separately.</note>
                </noteGrp>
